# SE-005: Centrifugal acceleration depends quadratically on rotation speed
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100g
add v1 SiO2 0.1g
grind v1 SiO2 5um
new
add v2 water 100g
add v2 SiO2 0.1g
grind v2 SiO2 5um
centrifuge v1 1000rpm 30s 10cm 100.1g
centrifuge v2 2000rpm 30s 10cm 100.1g
inspect
